Terminals unused in grammar

   REPEAT
   UNTIL


Grammar

    0 $accept: program $end

    1 program: statement_list

    2 statement_list: statement
    3               | statement_list statement

    4 statement: declaration_stmt
    5          | assignment_stmt
    6          | expression SEMICOLON
    7          | if_stmt
    8          | while_stmt
    9          | for_stmt
   10          | switch_stmt
   11          | function_decl
   12          | return_stmt

   13 declaration_stmt: type IDENTIFIER SEMICOLON
   14                 | CONST type IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expression SEMICOLON
   15                 | type IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expression SEMICOLON

   16 type: INT
   17     | FLOAT_TYPE
   18     | STRING_TYPE
   19     | CHAR_TYPE

   20 assignment_stmt: IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expression SEMICOLON

   21 assign: IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expression

   22 expression: expression PLUS T
   23           | expression MINUS T
   24           | T

   25 T: T MULTIPLY F
   26  | T DIVIDE F
   27  | T MODULO F
   28  | F

   29 F: LPAREN expression RPAREN
   30  | MINUS F
   31  | IDENTIFIER
   32  | FLOAT
   33  | NUMBER

   34 condition: expression EQUAL expression
   35          | expression NOT_EQUAL expression
   36          | expression LESS_THAN expression
   37          | expression GREATER_THAN expression
   38          | expression LESS_EQUAL expression
   39          | expression GREATER_EQUAL expression
   40          | expression AND expression
   41          | expression OR expression
   42          | NOT expression

   43 if_stmt: IF LPAREN condition RPAREN LBRACE statement RBRACE
   44        | IF LPAREN condition RPAREN LBRACE statement RBRACE ELSE LBRACE statement RBRACE

   45 while_stmt: WHILE LPAREN condition RPAREN LBRACE statement RBRACE

   46 for_stmt: FOR LPAREN declaration_stmt condition SEMICOLON assign RPAREN LBRACE statement RBRACE

   47 switch_stmt: SWITCH LPAREN IDENTIFIER RPAREN LBRACE case_list RBRACE
   48            | SWITCH LPAREN IDENTIFIER RPAREN LBRACE case_list default_case RBRACE

   49 case_list: case_stmt
   50          | case_list case_stmt

   51 case_stmt: CASE expression COLON statement
   52          | CASE expression COLON statement BREAK SEMICOLON

   53 default_case: DEFAULT COLON statement
   54             | DEFAULT COLON statement BREAK SEMICOLON

   55 function_decl: type IDENTIFIER LPAREN parameter_list RPAREN LBRACE statement RBRACE
   56              | type IDENTIFIER LPAREN RPAREN LBRACE statement RBRACE

   57 parameter_list: parameter
   58               | parameter_list COMMA parameter

   59 parameter: type IDENTIFIER

   60 return_stmt: RETURN expression SEMICOLON
   61            | RETURN SEMICOLON


